    "sub_name": "水滸傳與中國美學",
    "sub_ename": "\"WATER MARGIN\"AND CHINESE AESTHETICS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將涵攝故事、敘事方法與美感原則三者，為免流於讓學生坐著聽理論，會提不起興趣，將運用團隊協作互動化、文創製作操作化、故事寫作創造化等，或與數位化科技結合，進行課程活動的設計與課程成果的表現，期能提升學生從事各種文化創意產業之創新及創造的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will cover stories, narrative methods and aesthetic principles. In order to avoid letting students sit and listen to theory, which will lose interest, it will use team collaboration and interaction, cultural creation and production operations, and story writing to create creative methods. or combined with digital technology to design course activities and express course results, hoping to enhance students' ability to engage in innovation and creation in various cultural and creative industries.",
